{"3719540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TOTAL DRIFTIN': Touge Dreams", "steam_appid": 3719540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/b8cd5851a147774ad68415d26a2530e6.poster.avif?t=1781629331\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/b8cd5851a147774ad68415d26a2530e6.webm?t=1781629331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/b8cd5851a147774ad68415d26a2530e6.mp4?t=1781629331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the mountain. There are no rules here, only respect.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Total Driftin’: Touge Dreams</i></strong> is an arcade drift racing game set on the legendary Japanese mountain passes, the touge. With a retro aesthetic inspired by the '90s and a focus on pure drifting, it's a tribute to a golden era of street motorsport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>The drift</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A drifting system that balances control and flow, turning touge mastery into an art instead of a fight against the controls. Precise, readable handling with accessible controls: easy to pick up, satisfying to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/6b5a89ed448c5326a8959abfce0683e9.poster.avif?t=1781629331\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/6b5a89ed448c5326a8959abfce0683e9.webm?t=1781629331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/6b5a89ed448c5326a8959abfce0683e9.mp4?t=1781629331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The cars</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A carefully crafted selection of machines inspired by drifting legends, each with its own handling and character. No complicated customization, just you and the road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/6d6808c1f054bff6f2a78b2815dd5e01.avif?t=1781629331\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras_big/6d6808c1f054bff6f2a78b2815dd5e01.avif?t=1781629331 width=800 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The look</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized, cozy visuals with a cel-shaded touch, neon lights, sunset mountain landscapes, and menus that feel like they came straight out of a Japanese arcade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/a54239e01eba9dca30655b73d833de8a.avif?t=1781629331\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras_big/a54239e01eba9dca30655b73d833de8a.avif?t=1781629331 width=800 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The sound</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original score that pays tribute to the VHS and neon era, scoring every descent like a scene from an anime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/c7bf6a341e834fc8acec86f913b1398e.poster.avif?t=1781629331\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/c7bf6a341e834fc8acec86f913b1398e.webm?t=1781629331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/c7bf6a341e834fc8acec86f913b1398e.mp4?t=1781629331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Total Driftin’: Touge Dreams</i></strong> isn’t just a racing game. It’s a love letter to drifting, to the mountains, to the night, and to those impossible dreams that only come alive with the engine redlining.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/b8cd5851a147774ad68415d26a2530e6.poster.avif?t=1781629331\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/b8cd5851a147774ad68415d26a2530e6.webm?t=1781629331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/b8cd5851a147774ad68415d26a2530e6.mp4?t=1781629331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the mountain. There are no rules here, only respect.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Total Driftin’: Touge Dreams</i></strong> is an arcade drift racing game set on the legendary Japanese mountain passes, the touge. With a retro aesthetic inspired by the '90s and a focus on pure drifting, it's a tribute to a golden era of street motorsport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>The drift</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A drifting system that balances control and flow, turning touge mastery into an art instead of a fight against the controls. Precise, readable handling with accessible controls: easy to pick up, satisfying to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/6b5a89ed448c5326a8959abfce0683e9.poster.avif?t=1781629331\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/6b5a89ed448c5326a8959abfce0683e9.webm?t=1781629331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/6b5a89ed448c5326a8959abfce0683e9.mp4?t=1781629331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The cars</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A carefully crafted selection of machines inspired by drifting legends, each with its own handling and character. No complicated customization, just you and the road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/6d6808c1f054bff6f2a78b2815dd5e01.avif?t=1781629331\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras_big/6d6808c1f054bff6f2a78b2815dd5e01.avif?t=1781629331 width=800 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The look</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized, cozy visuals with a cel-shaded touch, neon lights, sunset mountain landscapes, and menus that feel like they came straight out of a Japanese arcade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/a54239e01eba9dca30655b73d833de8a.avif?t=1781629331\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras_big/a54239e01eba9dca30655b73d833de8a.avif?t=1781629331 width=800 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The sound</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original score that pays tribute to the VHS and neon era, scoring every descent like a scene from an anime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/c7bf6a341e834fc8acec86f913b1398e.poster.avif?t=1781629331\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/c7bf6a341e834fc8acec86f913b1398e.webm?t=1781629331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/c7bf6a341e834fc8acec86f913b1398e.mp4?t=1781629331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Total Driftin’: Touge Dreams</i></strong> isn’t just a racing game. It’s a love letter to drifting, to the mountains, to the night, and to those impossible dreams that only come alive with the engine redlining.</p>", "short_description": "Master each corner, burn rubber, and become a legend high in the Japanese mountains. Total Driftin’: Touge Dreams is a tribute to classic '90s drifting, with precise arcade physics, retro aesthetics, and a cult-like soul. Do you have what it takes to become a touge god?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/f819144b982b84f88dfde6c443bf515c836472a5/header.jpg?t=1781629331", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/62dee187f48475960fda801430f30984f32ffa83/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781629331", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/62dee187f48475960fda801430f30984f32ffa83/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781629331", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Inter Core i7-7700 @3.60GHz 3601 Mhz, 4-core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia Geforce GTX 1060 6GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Realtek high definition audio</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["FAS3 Estudios S.L."], "publishers": ["FAS3 Estudios S.L."], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 499, "final": 499, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$4.99"}, "packages": [1309423], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy TOTAL DRIFTIN': Touge Dreams", "description": "", "sel